sequenceDiagram
    participant PW as Playwright / CI
    participant B as Dev Service

    loop until 200 or timeout
        PW->>B: GET /health
        alt server not yet ready
            B--xPW: connection refused / 5xx
            Note over PW: wait 200 ms; retry
        else server ready
            B-->>PW: 200 { status: "ok" }
            Note over PW: proceed with test suite
        end
    end